  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Trust Fund of the Enhanced Integrated Framework Second Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to build capacity in LDC governments for the integration and coordination of trade policy in national development policy. As joint initiative created in 2009 by the World Bank, the WTO, ITC, UNDP and others, EIF is the only multilateral agency and funding mechanism with the exclusive mandate of strengthening the participation of LDC&#x2019;s in international trade. The EIF plays a key role in underpinning the development dimension of the WTO and as an advocate for the interests of LDC&#x2019;s in international trade. The 20 million DKK from Denmark in 2019 is the final Danish contribution for EIF&#x2019;s Phase 2 (2015-2022), complementing the 60 million DDK Denmark contributed in 2017.</narrative>
  </description>
